sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant B as Replica B
    participant DB as Database
    participant A as Replica A
    C->>B: CancelTask
    B->>DB: Canceled + mark claim
    B-->>C: Canceled
    A->>DB: renew claim (1 s)
    DB-->>A: marked
    A->>A: fire the token
    A->>DB: next write
    DB-->>A: refused
    A->>A: adopt Canceled
